  "bodyHash": "gwBVS4nahmw=",
  "content": "<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/logo.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"130\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 這個模組新增了特殊飾品，讓遊戲體驗更加豐富。<br>所有飾品的詳細說明可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsAccessories/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>找到。<br><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">本模組需要安裝<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/majrusz-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Majrusz函式庫</a>才能運作！</span></strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/stuff.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>效能加成</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 所有飾品都帶有隨機效能加成，影響其實用性。<br>系統會動態生成說明文字，顯示包含效能加成的實際數值。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/bonus.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>回收機制</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 多餘的重複飾品可透過特定村民交易出售。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/trades.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>提升效能加成</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可將同類飾品組合來重新擲骰效能加成數值。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/crafting.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>組合不同飾品</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 特定飾品可組合為新型飾品，繼承所有加成效果。<br>部分加成在新飾品中效果會更加強大！<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/crafting2.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>如何啟動飾品？</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 若安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a>模組，飾品需放入新增的「口袋」欄位生效。<br>否則僅能在副手持握時發揮效果。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/pocket_slot.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/pocket_slot2.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>還有更多功能！</strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/languages.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"185\"> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/thanks.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - 感謝<a href=\"https://github.com/HaooooZhang\" rel=\"nofollow\">HaooooZhang</a>提供簡體中文翻譯<br>- 感謝<a href=\"https://github.com/spliitbtw\" rel=\"nofollow\">spliitbtw</a>提供西班牙文翻譯<br>- 感謝<a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a>提供烏克蘭文翻譯<br>- 感謝もふざとう (mohuzato)提供日文翻譯<br></span> <br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UF774WcuW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/discord.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a> <br><a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsAccessories/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/mod_wiki.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a></h6>",
